OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,FA consortium including the Amazon
OL,7,Ffounder Jeff Bezos has confirmed that
OL,8,Fit will buy a 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,9,FFootball Club.
OL,11,FBezos, one of the world's richest men,
OL,12,Fhas become part of a syndicate which
OL,13,Fis led by Amit Bhatia, the son-in-law
OL,14,Fof billionaire steel tycoon Lakshmi
OL,15,FMittal.
OL,17,FBezos has invested, but will not take
OL,18,Fup a position at the club. Instead,
OL,19,FAmit Bhatia will join Liverpool's
OL,20,Fboard and become the new vice-chairman.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
