OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,FThe club say this new money will not
OL,7,Fhave an impact on new signings in the
OL,8,Ftransfer window.
OL,10,FFenway Sports Group (FSG), which also
OL,11,Fowns the Boston Red Sox and Pittsburgh
OL,12,FPenguins, has controlled Liverpool
OL,13,Fsince 2010.
OL,15,FThey will continue to be the majority
OL,16,Fowners and in control of the club.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
