OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,FFSG bought the club for #300 million
OL,7,Fwhen it was struggling financially,
OL,8,Fand Forbes now values Liverpool at
OL,9,Faround #4.6 billion, making the deal
OL,10,Fone of the biggest in football history.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday 21 July, FSG confirmed that
OL,13,FBhatia's group had approached them to
OL,14,Fdiscuss investing in the club.
OL,16,FThey say this investment will support
OL,17,FLiverpool's long-term growth ambitions
OL,18,Fby bringing together experts from
OL,19,Facross global business, technology,
OL,20,Fand investment.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,FMike Gordon, FSG President said:
OL,7,F"Liverpool has always been built by
OL,8,Fthinking beyond one season and making
OL,9,Fdecisions with the club's long-term
OL,10,Finterests in mind.
OL,12,F"That approach continues to attract
OL,13,Finterest from respected investors and
OL,14,Fbusiness leaders around the world.
OL,16,F"As we considered this opportunity, it
OL,17,Fbecame clear that Amit and the
OL,18,Fconsortium shared our long-term
OL,19,Fphilosophy and appreciation for what
OL,20,Fmakes Liverpool special.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,F"Their experience and perspective will
OL,7,Fcomplement the strong foundation
OL,8,Falready in place, and we look forward
OL,9,FtoJworking together."
OL,11,FAmit Bhatia said: "We are incredibly
OL,12,Fproud to be investing in Liverpool
OL,13,FFootball Club and to be doing so
OL,14,Falongside FSG. We have the utmost
OL,15,Frespect and admiration for FSG as
OL,16,Fowners and for everything they have
OL,17,Fachieved at Anfield. To be welcomed as
OL,18,Fa partner in a club of this stature is
OL,19,Fa huge privilege.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
