OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1787428109
OL,3,CJeff Bezos buys 30% stake in Liverpool
OL,4,CFC as part of consortium
OL,6,F"We are making this investment because
OL,7,Fwe believe deeply in Liverpool and its
OL,8,Fleadership, and we look forward to
OL,9,Fsupporting the club's continued
OL,10,Fsuccess for years to come."
